  "body": "Broke by #12168. Element web sends a hidden read receipt type, which Synapse doesn't understand and so 400s:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/0ce2201932488e98cab8a7d81788e5bcf8f8dd5e/synapse/rest/client/read_marker.py#L57-L63\r\n\r\nThis is a problem as it stops the *other* receipt types from being persisted.\r\n\r\n\r\nWe shouldn't be denying unknown receipt types.",
